<title>USA: Federal-Mogul closes sale of Turkey branch.</title>
<headline>Federal-Mogul closes sale of Turkey branch.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal-Mogul Corp said Monday it completed the sale of its aftermarket auto parts branch in Turkey to ADT Otomotiv Tic AS, a Turkish corporation owned by the branch's general manager.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced, but Federal-Mogul said it will maintain supply agreements covering about 85 percent of the product line offered by the branch.</p>
<p>Federal-Mogul makes and distributes parts for automobiles, light trucks, heavy trucks and farm and construction vehicles.</p>
<p>Its shares were off 1/8 Monday at 24-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
